# The fixture of CQ-P05 (report 04 sections 3.1 and 4, report 18 section 10): the one identity CQ-P04's must-fail case
# states the forbidden way, test_AcmeA and test_AcmeB said to be the same by owl:sameAs. It is read only beside
# CQ-P04's fixture, with test_Decision1 removed. Every name starts `test_`.
@base <https://example.org/inventory-import/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

<fixture/SourceRecord/test_AcmeA> owl:sameAs <fixture/SourceRecord/test_AcmeB> .
